{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 110,
    "dDurationMs": 6230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "According to popular myth, cockroaches would\ninherit a post nuclear disaster world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6340,
    "dDurationMs": 4179,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But it looks like the real winners might actually\nbe fungi."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 10519,
    "dDurationMs": 7281,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In 1999 fungi were found to be thriving in\nhighly radioactive conditions inside the Chernobyl"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 17800,
    "dDurationMs": 1310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "reactor."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 19110,
    "dDurationMs": 5950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These fungi are rich in melanin, yup, the\nsame stuff that gives you tan in summer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 25060,
    "dDurationMs": 5770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "While radiation causes cell damage and mutations\nin most living creatures, melanin rich fungi"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 30830,
    "dDurationMs": 2690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are actually attracted to the stuff."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 33520,
    "dDurationMs": 5360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it seems the spherical nature of the melanin\nacts as a shield, but it also allows energy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 38880,
    "dDurationMs": 4420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to be absorbed from the radiation, enhancing\nthe fungi’s growth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 43300,
    "dDurationMs": 5270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These fungi may one day help clean up radioactive\nwaste or even lead to the development of new"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 48570,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "cancer treatments."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 49570,
    "dDurationMs": 5270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if there is a nuclear accident in the\nmeantime, don’t panic right away."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 54840,
    "dDurationMs": 3370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That mushroom cloud might not be what you\nthink it is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 58210,
    "dDurationMs": 5450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hey, everyone, that is just a little segment\nI voiced for an Aussie TV show called Catalyst."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 63660,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And actually I have been traveling with this\nTV show for the last five weeks, in case you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 67200,
    "dDurationMs": 1390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "have been wondering where I was."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 68590,
    "dDurationMs": 5330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And, in fact, I have been traveling with two\nother people, Anya and Simon."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 73920,
    "dDurationMs": 4390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ok, so we are doing Catalyst on the road,\nwhich is actually a road trip from Perth to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 78310,
    "dDurationMs": 3470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Melbourne and we have had an amazing time\nincluding things like ..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 81780,
    "dDurationMs": 2140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Cave diving."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 83920,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e And"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 84920,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Catching Malawi."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 85920,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e And land sailing on a salt lake."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 87750,
    "dDurationMs": 3409,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we have done some incredible stuff and\nthat is all going to go to air in Australia"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 91159,
    "dDurationMs": 1671,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on ABC-1 starting in February."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 92830,
    "dDurationMs": 5020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you want to check out their YouTube channel,\nyou can look at it ... I will put an annotation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 97850,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 98850,
    "dDurationMs": 1230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can click this and go to their YouTube\nchannel."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 100080,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if you are really nice to them, maybe\nthey will post some of this episode, some"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 102880,
    "dDurationMs": 3250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of these episodes on their YouTube channel."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 106130,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Besides that, I will be back in Sydney after\nChristmas and then I will make some more Veritasium"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 110530,
    "dDurationMs": 3650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "style stuff, so stay tuned for that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 114180,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is disgusting."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 115500,
    "dDurationMs": 6160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I cannot believe this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 121660,
    "dDurationMs": 4489,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ahh."
    } ]
  } ]
}
